;
; Wordhoard's headword index in MYRA (wordhoard_rules.h WH6): one record a
; headword and sense, by the headword's name code (kindred_rules.h KR2)
; and then its synset number (OEWN's offset times 10 plus its part of
; speech), holding the word's language (its place in xlate.languages, 0
; not known), which list it came from (0 the owner's own, 1 the core
; pack, 2 the optional pack) and that list's mtime (seconds since 1970).
; A prefix search walks ^ZXWORDHOARD in order ($ORDER) from the typed
; code up to the range kindred.name_prefix_hit tests one code against.
^ZXWORDHOARD(word:i18, sense:i9) = lang:i3! ^ list:i1! ^ stamp:i12!
